# Azure Data Factory Notes

Data orchestration and integration service.

## Topics

- Azure Data Factory  
  Tool to create and schedule data pipelines.  
  Real-life: Moving data from source to data lake.

- Pipelines and Activities  
  Pipeline contains activities.  
  Real-life: Copy + transformation workflows.

- Linked Services and Datasets  
  Connections and metadata.  
  Real-life: Connecting to databases and storage.

- Triggers  
  Schedule or event-based execution.  
  Real-life: Daily batch or file arrival trigger.

- Parameters and Variables  
  Used for dynamic pipelines.  
  Real-life: Same pipeline for multiple files.

- Incremental Load  
  Load only new or changed data.  
  Real-life: Daily data sync.

- Duplicate Handling  
  Preventing duplicate records.  
  Real-life: Idempotent pipelines.
